{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はツインテールの日でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/03/1946672/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は昨日\nツイアワでヲタクしてたわけだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだブログに載せたことなくて\nメンバーがツインテールしてる写メを探してたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/03/1946672/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつのだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は髪長いし\n中田は髪短いし\n衣装は君の名だし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうど1年前くらいのでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/02/03/1946672/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログに貼ったことないよね？(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前にもなると\nもう覚えてないんだけど\n貼ってないってことで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n今日は節分かもしれないけど\nふれないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の\nツインテールの日のが大事なので`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりツインテールって素晴らしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールしてる子が踊った時の\nツインテールがぴょんぴょんするの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い。\n素晴らしい。\n芸術。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日からPigooで生ドルが放送されてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-